From: XXRI OS Team
Subject: [PATCH] XXRI window decorations

The XXRI OS Lite window manager: titlebar on top (-DTOPSIDE) with XXRI
geometry, palette, controls and title font (-DXXRI), plus the window
manager fixes made for the XXRI shell (dock-aware maximise via
XXRI_DOCK_RESERVE, launching without zombies).  Generated from the fork
formerly kept outside version control in work/flwm-xxri.
---
